	(descr "PRELIMINARY. Kingbright APBA2006SURKCGKC right-angle/side-view bi-colour (red+green) chip LED, 2.0mm long body, two independent diodes (no internal common terminal). Pad numbers follow the Device:LED_Dual_AAKK symbol used on the schematic, NOT the datasheet pin numbers: pad1=A_red, pad2=A_green, pad3=K_red, pad4=K_green. Physical left-to-right order is pad3(K_red), pad1(A_red), pad2(A_green), pad4(K_green) = datasheet pins 1,4,3,2. Verify land geometry and pin mapping against Kingbright spec DSAQ1665 before routing; the optical coupling to the light pipe is a separate open gate.")
